<rml>
<head>
	<title>dreamcomp</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="dreamcomp.rcss"/>
	<!-- A port's own frontend/port.rcss (LAUNCHER_DIR in dreamcomp_add_port) is linked after this
	     by the launcher when present, so it can override colours or add art. The screens are
	     generated into #page by src/frontend/menu_ui.cpp; the same document is shown before the
	     game (SDL renderer) and over it (CPU renderer, body class "ingame"). -->
</head>
<body>
	<div id="page"></div>
</body>
</rml>
